# Web UI

- Side-view SVG is the primary diagram: shelves, valance, LED as a strip, eye, glare rays.
- Red ray = unobstructed path to the eye. Green ray = occluded. Status text must match the geometry result.
- Every numeric parameter has a slider and an input; they stay in sync.
- Persist the full calculator state in the URL query string so a link reproduces the scene.
- Desktop: diagram and controls side by side. Narrow viewports: diagram above controls.
- Validate physically impossible layouts in the UI (LED past the front edge, non-positive gap) without crashing the renderer.
